# Day 22 - Images and DevTools

## 📚 Learning Objectives

* Learned how to display images.
* Learned the src attribute.
* Learned the alt attribute.
* Learned how to inspect pages using DevTools.

## HTML Tag Learned

### Image Tag

```html
<img>
```

Displays images.

## Image Attributes

### src

Specifies the image location.

Example:

```html
<img src="profile.jpg">
```

### alt

Alternative text shown if the image fails to load.

Example:

```html
alt="Profile Photo"
```

## CSS Properties

### width

```css
width:200px;
```

Controls image size.

### border-radius

```css
border-radius:20px;
```

Creates rounded corners.

## DevTools

Opened the browser inspector and experimented with image properties.

## Practical Work

* Added a profile image.
* Styled the image.
* Used DevTools to test changes.

## Key Takeaways

* img displays images.
* src tells the browser where the image is.
* alt improves accessibility.
* DevTools help inspect and test webpages.
